      "created_at": "2018-07-19T19:50:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, I played my first game in the Celestial Tribunal--Fanatic, Captain Cosmic, Tempest and Haka vs. Ambuscade.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Celestial Tribunal's first play was Representative of Earth. I picked Stuntman, because then it would kind of be like \"The Trial of Ambuscade.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Guess he was guilty--Between the Explosive Launcher that kept coming back, Charged Attacks that I couldn't seem to get rid of, and Sonic Mines blowing up all over, Stuntman went down!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>I got to see the cool end game image of the Celestial Tribunal's judgment!&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sorry, Earth. Guess the judicial-bots&nbsp;consider vainglorious French hubris unworthy of cosmic existence.</p>",
